(1. Election Safety: At most one leader can be elected in a given term.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
50 476 Td
(2. Leader Append-Only: A leader never overwrites or truncates its log; it only appends new entries.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
50 461 Td
(3. Log Matching: If two logs contain an entry with the same index and term, then the logs are identical up to that index.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
50 446 Td
(4. Leader Completeness: If a log entry is committed in a given term, it is present in the logs of all leaders for higher terms.) Tj
